cific islander', 'white'. Patient race, Answer = black or african american. Age at diagnosis, Question = Predict the patient's age at diagnosis for <omics> based on the gene expression profile.. Age at diagnosis, Answer = 34. Tumor descriptor, Question = Determine the tumor type of this specimen using <omics>.. Tumor descriptor, Answer = Primary. T stage, Question = Given the gene expression profile, what is the T stage of <omics>?. T stage, Answer = T4a. N stage, Question = <omics> Given this expression profile, what is the N stage of this specimen?. N stage, Answer = N1b. Mstage, Question = Identify the distant metastasis (M) stage using <omics>.. Mstage, Answer = M0. GTEx tissue, Question = <omics> What does the above expression profile reveal about the tissue of origin? Possible answers: \"Spleen\", \"Stomach\", \"Liver\", \"Brain\", \"Testis\", \"Adipose Tissue\", \"Heart\", \"Colon\", \"Kidney\", \"Pituitary\". GTEx tissue, Answer = Stomach. Perturbation, Question = . Perturbation, Answer = . Top expressed genes, Question = Given the following gene expression profile, list the 69 most highly expressed genes. <omics>. Top expressed genes, Answer = ACTB, CD24, TMSB4X, HSPA8, EEF2, POU5F1, ACTG1, OAZ1, LDHB, HNRNPA2B1, LAPTM4B, SFRP1, SLC16A1, MIF, FADS2, HSP90AA1, KRT18, EEF1G, CRABP1, CFL1, PFN1.... KOgene identifica- tion, Question = Given the control <omics> <omics> <omics> <omics> <omics> and the perturbed <omics> <omics> <omics> <omics> <omics> , determine the gene whose knockout caused this change.. KOgene identifica- tion, Answer = METTL14\n(continued on next page)\n\n\nA Appendix A.7 Task Examples (continued from previous page) Top genes post-KO, Question = Control expression profile: <omics> <omics> <omics> <omics> <omics> List the 60 most highly expressed genes after knocking out METTL14.. Top genes post-KO, Answer = ACTB, CD24, EEF2, POU5F1, HSPA8, TUBB2B, ACTG1, OAZ1, H1-5, CLDN6, LDHB, TMSB4X, SCD, HNRNPA2B1, SLC16A1, LAPTM4B, TUBB2A, GJA1, NACC1, A